```

This flow diagram outlines the steps for monitoring and addressing overheating issues in a system. The main focus is on monitoring temperatures, processor load, fan speed, and error logs to identify potential causes of overheating. Once identified, actions such as ending non-essential processes, increasing fan speed, lowering maximum processor usage, or even decreasing the room temperature can be taken to maintain optimal processor temperature.

